WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.300
(CROWD CHEERING

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.470
 ALANIS MORISSETTE:
<i> People would say,
 "Wow, you're so brave,</i>

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:04.704
<i> you're so empowered."</i>

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.239
(CROWD APPLAUDING)

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:07.606
MORISSETTE:
<i>I can't write all these songs</i>

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:09.642
without obviously having been
disempowered.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.148
We couldn't get signed.
Everybody rejected us.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.417
It's too in your face,
it's too emotional.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.253
I am mad right now,
and when I'm 34,

00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:21.821
<i> you won't get a record
 like that.</i>

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:24.424
♪ (SINGING
"ONE HAND IN MY POCKET") ♪

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.233 line:0%
 SPEAKER:<i> Was there room
 for Alanis in rock? No.</i>

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.002
<i> But you try to ignore
 the song.</i>

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.737
<i> You're not gonna write
 a better song</i>

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:38.771
<i> than "You Oughta Know".</i>

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.372
They put in a cassette tape.

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.374
<i> Within 30 seconds,
 everything changed.</i>

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:46.546 line:0%
And it just went nuclear, man.
It was like-- it went nuclear.

00:00:47.312 --> 00:00:49.783
♪ (CROWD SINGING "IRONIC) ♪

00:00:56.689 --> 00:01:00.159
MORISSETTE:<i> Empowerment
as a young woman in the '90s,</i>

00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:04.096
<i> singing about it was not
good news for the patriarchy.</i>

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.232
You were just immediately
shut down.

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:09.002
SHIRLEY MANSON:
<i>When you are the only woman</i>

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.403
<i>in a male dominated environment,</i>

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:13.406
it's very complicated
and complex.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.309
SPEAKER 2:<i> Her brutal honesty
 empowered women.</i>

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:20.580
<i>It gave you a chance to let out
 your own feelings.</i>

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.149
KEVIN SMITH:
<i> This is a female artist</i>

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:26.085
<i> that transcended gender,</i>

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.555
where dudes could be like,
"I feel the same way."

00:01:29.688 --> 00:01:31.124
 MORISETTE:<i> Without even
 knowing I was doing it,</i>

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:35.895
<i>I was carving out my voice.
This is dream come true stuff.</i>

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:39.098
<i>♪ 'Cause I've got one hand
 In my pocket ♪</i>

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:42.801
<i>♪ And the other one is hailing
 A taxicab ♪</i>

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:45.305
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:48.141
(CROWD CHEERING)

